# Vendored git submodules. They are consumed as external repositories
# (new_local_repository / local_repository / local_*_repository in
# WORKSPACE.bazel), so `bazel build //...` must not descend into them as
# packages of the main repository -- their nested BUILD files (e.g.
# benchmark's Python bindings needing @nanobind_bazel) do not load here.
ThirdParty/Logging
ThirdParty/Memory
ThirdParty/Profiler
ThirdParty/benchmark
ThirdParty/fmt
ThirdParty/googletest
ThirdParty/mimalloc
ThirdParty/sleef
